{"id":"cb20ae7a7e543a78","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md","title":"ZFC Graph Connected Graph","display":"df-zfc-graph-connected-graph — ZFC Graph Connected Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-connected-graph — ZFC Graph Connected Graph","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-graph]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-connected-graph — ZFC Graph Connected Graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,V_G,E_G\\in V\">\\(G,V_G,E_G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S\\)</span> (graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}connected\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\exists V_G,E_G\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\land V_G\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall u,v\\in V_G\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists p\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(p,n+1,V_G)\\land p(0)=u\\land p(n)=v\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\{p(i),p(i+1)\\}\\in E_G)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}connected\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\exists V_G,E_G\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\land V_G\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall u,v\\in V_G\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists p\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(p,n+1,V_G)\\land p(0)=u\\land p(n)=v\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\{p(i),p(i+1)\\}\\in E_G)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph code is unpacked as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\">\\(\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\)</span> because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S\\)</span> does not introduce accessor functions. Connectivity is witnessed by a finite vertex sequence whose consecutive unordered pairs are edges.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S$ (graph predicate, see [[58-df-graph]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"G,V_G,E_G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}connected\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\exists V_G,E_G\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\land V_G\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall u,v\\in V_G\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists p\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(p,n+1,V_G)\\land p(0)=u\\land p(n)=v\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\{p(i),p(i+1)\\}\\in E_G)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1279,"backlinks":[{"id":"258c3f0de8f3cacf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGraphConnectedGraph}_S$ (connected-graph predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph.md|58-df-zfc-graph-connected-graph]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0dc79ccc1050ee64","36d7463d215be751"]}